# Specify files that shouldn't be modified by Fern

LICENSE
README.md

# The frozen openapi-generator SDK. Plaid owns this directory and publishes
# updates to it independently; Fern must never touch it.
legacy

# One go.mod covers both SDKs, so it must carry the legacy SDK's
# golang.org/x/oauth2 requirement. Hand-maintained via `go mod tidy`.
go.mod
go.sum
